SUMMARY:Walk Brevard to See White Squirrels & More!
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nTake a walking tour of th
 e city of Brevard. We will meet at 9:00. This walk will be 5 KM (3 miles).
 \n\nWalk through picturesque neighborhoods\, the grounds of a stately old 
 mansion\, a quaint park\, and a vibrant downtown. End with a stroll throug
 h Brevard College\, known for its music programs and small school atmosphe
 re\; the campus features a swift flowing stream and a fine clock tower. We
  often seen white squirrels scampering about\; how many will you see?\n\nT
 his easy walk has some fairly gentle hills but is mostly on pavement. Dres
 s for the weather. Tennis shoes should be fine\; few will want walking pol
 es. Be sure to bring water and a protein snack. Dogs are welcome. Stroller
 s should be ok\, with simple workarounds for the place or two where needed
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/313256677/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260207T214931Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260207T214931Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
