DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T123000
SUMMARY:Historic Columbia SC Morning Walk—Governor's Mansion\, Finlay Pa
 rk\, and More!
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at 10:00 a.m. in the
  lobby of the Hampton Inn\, 822 Gervais Street\, Columbia 29223 (enter the
  lobby from the Lincoln Street side). Restrooms are available at the start
  point.\n\nThe trail takes you past the Woodrow Wilson Boyhood Home\, arou
 nd the Governor's Mansion\, through the newly reopened Finlay Park\, and t
 hrough Memorial Park.\n\nThere are some moderate hills and stair climbing\
 , but it is almost entirely on pavement. Tennis shoes are fine\; some may 
 want walking sticks or hiking boots.\n\nDress for the weather. It will lik
 ely be very hot. A hat and sunscreen are highly recommended.\n\n**Plenty o
 f water** and a protein snack are advised as always. Wheelchairs are not r
 ecommended\, although strollers ought to be ok. Dogs are welcome.\n\nOur M
 eetup group offers some version of this walk every three months. It's that
  good! You will surely enjoy it.\n\nTraditionally\, many of us eat at Five
  Guys (near the start point) after the walk. There are lots of other resta
 urants nearby. Give yourself plenty of time to enjoy your meal after you j
 oin the group for the walk.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314585809/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260501T224119Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T224119Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
