DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T160000
SUMMARY:Walk Waynesville from Mast General to Auburn Park & Green Hill Cem
 etery & Back
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at 2:00 in front of 
 the shoe department entrance to Mast General Store\, 63 N. Main St.\, Wayn
 esville NC 28786. The walk goes down Main Street\, through the Auburn Park
  neighborhood\, twice around Green Hill Cemetery\, past the Shelton House 
 Museum and HART Theater\, and back to the start point.\n\nThere are some h
 ills\, so some may want a walking pole\; sneakers should be fine. Dogs are
  welcome. Strollers should be ok. Bring plenty of water and a protein snac
 k. Dress appropriately for the weather.\n\nParking is easier a block to ei
 ther side of Main Street. Mast General Store doesn't have a public restroo
 m\, but we can direct you to one nearby should you need it.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314928120/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260523T225800Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260523T225800Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
